# Enemy: "Shadow Visitor" (그림자 손님). Tall, hunched silhouette in a long
# tattered coat, about 2.2x the protagonist's height. One glowing red eye and a
# moonlight rim (M) on its right edge so it stays readable in dark scenes.
# 32x56 frames, faces right.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 32 56
@output ../characters/enemy_shadow_visitor.png
@preview ../previews/enemy_shadow_visitor_x4.png 4
@columns 5

@frame idle_0
